              <h3>What interpersonal skills are used when working in cyber security?</h3>
<p>There is a skills shortage in cyber security, and this is not only focused on specialised technical skills it also related to what are called soft skills such as interpersonal skills.</p>
<p>Let's take a look the skills required.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
